		  <!-- TemplateBeginEditable name="PageContent" -->
			<article>
			  <h1>Welcome to Extreme Honeymoons</h1>
			  <p>If you are just getting hitched, we can help make your honeymoon outrageous.
			    Take a look at our Excursions and take the opportunity to complete our survey.</p>
			  <h2>Our Adventure Packages</h2>
			  <img src="../Images/fullsize/Image1Lg.jpg" id="theImage" alt="Honeymoon Adventure" width="300">
			  <div id="thumbs"> <img src="../Images/thumbnails/image1sm.jpg" alt="Couple on boat" onMouseOver="swapImage(0);" /> <img src="../Images/thumbnails/image2sm.jpg" alt="Snowboarder in air" onMouseOver="swapImage(1);" /> <img src="../Images/thumbnails/image3sm.jpg" alt="Couple hiking" onMouseOver="swapImage(2);" /> <img src="../Images/thumbnails/image4sm.jpg" alt="Couple biking" onMouseOver="swapImage(3);" /> </div>
			  <div id="bottomText"></div>
			  <h2>Featured Tribute</h2>
			  <img src="../Images/Extremehoneymoons-images/Tributes/SkiCouple1Sm.jpg" alt="Skiing couple smiling at the camera" class="image_left" width="250" height="166">
			  <p> We just wanted to thank you folks at Extreme Honeymoons for a rip-roaring time during our honeymoon trip.  I had always wanted to try heliskiing, and my honeymoon seemed as good a time to go for it.  Both my wife Mary and I are experienced downhill skiers, but we had never tried extreme skiing or snowboarding before. </p>
			  <p><a href="#">more &gt;&gt;</a></p>
		  </article>
